        "reasoning"
      ],
      "truth": "CREATE INDEX without CONCURRENTLY holds a lock that blocks every insert and update on items until the index is built, so the shop stops taking writes for as long as the build takes on a large table. The fix is CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY, outside a transaction.",
