      ],
      "truth": "privileged: true gives the API container every capability and the node's devices, so a flaw in the app becomes root on the node; allowPrivilegeEscalation: true lets its processes gain more privileges than they started with. A raw-socket health check needs only the NET_RAW capability, so the fix is to drop privileged, keep allowPrivilegeEscalation false and add NET_RAW alone.",
